  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **East Colorado Avenue**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2018-06-21.dpa4061.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 75 min [1]\n- **billystrings2018-06-21.flac16schoepsmk2s**: source not stated; 12 songs; 74 min [3]\n- **billystrings2018-06-21.koto.digihoarders.16441**: source not stated; 12 songs; 72 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Sam Bush joined on mandolin; the set was played on the Fred Shellman Memorial Stage [1]\n- Planet Bluegrass permitted taping at the festival [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2018-06-21.dpa4061.flac**: taped by Cheese Cadet Audio; transferred by Cheese Cadet Audio; source: DPA 4061’s (Matched - Healy Method w/ Foam Ball Baffle @ 180˚ - FOB - 8’ LOC - 11’ High) > Darktrain Microdot Y-Cable/ Interconnect > Naiant PIPsqueak (+26dB)… [1]. Also: Captured on a Tascam DR70D at 24-bit/44.1 kHz, then mastered in Adobe Audition, dithered with iZotope MBIT+, tracked in Audacity and encoded to FLAC [1]\n- **billystrings2018-06-21.flac16schoepsmk2s**: taped by Richard Skaggs; transferred by Richard Skaggs; source: Schoeps MK2s>KC5>CMC6>Oade Warm Mod Marantz PMD 661 [3]. Also: Audience recording with Schoeps MK2S mics spaced 20 inches apart, into a Marantz PMD 661 with Oade warm mod, recorded 24/48; Richard Skaggs taped, transferred, processed and tracked it, dithering to 16-bit/44.1 kHz [3]\n- **billystrings2018-06-21.koto.digihoarders.16441**: taped by DiGiHoArDeRs; transferred by DiGiHoArDeRs; source: koto.org (radiorethink) stream [2]",
